    {
      "heading": "Supported File Types",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "DSPM scans the following file types in storage services and virtual machines, but not in databases:"
    },
    {
      "text": "DSPM uses Optical Character Recognition (OCR) to identify sensitive data in image files and in images that are embedded within PDF or Microsoft Office documents."
    },
